<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Create Food</h1>
<p>Sphere: Creation Sphere
Spell Tier: 1
Class: Healer (guild level 18)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre><a cmd='#'>cast create food</a>
</pre>
<p>By praying to the gods, you receive a gift of food to stave off hunger: a 
piece of salted beef. It is not particularly tasty, nor very varied, but it 
is filling, and it is safe to eat (see <a cmd='#'>Help Eat</a>).
</p><p>You must be standing. It is also found on staffs, scrolls and wands. For 
something to drink, see <a cmd='#'>Help Create Water</a>.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Eat</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Create Water</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Sustain</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Creation Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>